- The emulator core is jsnes 2.1.0, used unmodified from npm and bundled
  into the built page.
- src/audio/audioOutput.ts and src/audio/sampleRing.ts adapt the approach of
  jsnes's src/browser/speakers.js: AudioWorklet code loaded from a Blob URL,
  emulator samples batched over the worklet's MessagePort into a ring buffer
  that drops the oldest samples when full. Changes: the ring buffer is a
  separate, tested class whose source text is injected into the worklet; it
  waits for a minimum fill before playing and again after running dry; the
  output has a gain stage for volume and mute.
- src/player/screenRenderer.ts follows jsnes's src/browser/screen.js in
  turning jsnes's 0x00BBGGRR frame pixels into canvas RGBA by setting the
  alpha byte.

