- src/vendor/rompatcher/ holds BinFile.js, HashCalculator.js,
  RomPatcher.format.bps.js and RomPatcher.format.ips.js from its
  rom-patcher-js/modules/ directory at commit
  3183884086825c3a57c72026234debcef1e2240c, with its LICENSE file. Changes,
  each marked "retrowright:" in the file: ES module imports and exports in
  place of globals and module.exports, BinFile's Node block (which loaded fs
  for file paths) removed, and variables that were assigned without being
  declared declared with var, since an ES module is strict. The .d.ts files
  beside them are retrowright's own.
